   "text": "Server routes (TypeScript)\n• Auth check on every request\n• Seed / reset demo\n• Send + fast-forward (simulated email)\n• Process a reply (A2 pipeline)\n• Normalize + scenario engine (pure code)\n• Ask engine (A3) · Award memo\n• Rate limits per account",
